# Linux app

- UI is GTK 4 + PyGObject; window runs as the user, never as root
- Root only via `pkexec` for ACPI dump and stick write
- Only USB disks; refuse system mounts (`/`, `/boot`, `/home`, …) and open LUKS/LVM/RAID
- Re-identify the stick by serial/size/model before erase
- State under `$XDG_STATE_HOME/nullmoth/1401/`; no log upload on Linux
- Tests must not touch real disks:

```bash
python3 -m unittest tests.test_linux_usb tests.test_linux_root
python3 linux/1401.py --selftest
```
